<title>UK: Lloyds Abbey Life yr pretax profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Lloyds Abbey Life yr pretax profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>					 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    548.1		  vs 421.5</p>
<p> Net profit		 365.6		  vs 274.8</p>
<p>New business</p>
<p>   Regular premiums     127.4		  vs 121.2</p>
<p>   Single premiums	703.9		  vs 665.6</p>
<p>   Unit trusts	    504.6		  vs 322.7</p>
<p> Total assets	     14,745.2	     vs 13,208.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Lloyds Abbey Life Plc, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Lloyds TSB Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
